  "Notes": "Lineage 2 Prominence \u2014 0.1.4\n\nMovement and targeting\n- Camera-relative WASD movement, including strafing and diagonals. Holding both mouse buttons moves forward; middle mouse toggles camera-following autorun.\n- Smoother acceleration, sharper-turn slowdown, and braking when stopping or approaching monsters and NPCs.\n- Tab selects eligible targets within 1500 units and inside the camera view. Targets can also be clicked while moving.\n- Improved monster position synchronization, obstacle navigation, and spreading during combat. Stuck monsters can recover toward their target.\n- Reduced terrain clipping when descending steep slopes.\n\nWorld and client\n- Added generated geodata for 125 playable map regions to improve terrain, collision, and pathfinding. Some regions still lack coverage; navigation issues may remain.\n- Personal keybinds now survive launcher updates and repairs.\n- Updated Ice Bolt's casting and projectile visuals.\n\nClose Lineage II, update the launcher if offered, then click Update before reconnecting.\n",
